The openmp directory contains tests that combine hipfort with OpenMP offload.
These require an LLVM Flang based compiler (amdflang, or upstream flang) with
OpenMP offload support. They are registered by test/CMakeLists.txt and run
through CTest like the other tests; with any other compiler, or when the
offload check or the host LAPACK lookup fails, they are silently skipped.
The GPU architecture defaults to "native" and can be overridden with
-DHIPFORT_OFFLOAD_ARCH=gfxNNN. The standalone CMakeLists.txt in this directory
is an alternative, self-contained build; it is not part of the main build, it
rejects non-LLVM-Flang compilers outright, and it requires the architecture
explicitly, with -DGPU_ARCH=gfxNNN.
